{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_86_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，齊侯伐宋，圍閔。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_86_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"伐國不言圍邑，此其言圍何也？不正其以惡報惡也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_86_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，庚寅，宋公茲父卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_86_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"茲父之不葬何也？失民也。其失民何也？以其不教民戰，則是棄其師也。為人君而棄其師，其民孰以為君哉？","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_86_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"三、秋，楚人伐陳。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_86_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_86","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有一月，杞子卒。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}